<Base title="Privacy Information | Litbuy Sheet Lab" description="Information about language and currency storage, browser-local image matching, analytics and links to third-party platforms."><main class="long-guide information-page"><h1>Privacy information</h1><p>Updated November 20, 2026.</p><h2>Local preferences</h2><p>Language and currency choices and cached exchange rates may be stored in your browser's local storage. Image-search result identifiers are stored in session storage. You can clear these through your browser's site-data settings.</p><h2>Image search</h2><p>The image you select is processed locally in your browser against downloaded catalog image descriptors. This implementation does not upload your selected image to a search server. Product images, catalog descriptors and other site assets still require network downloads.</p><h2>Traffic measurement</h2><p>This website uses Google Analytics 4 (measurement ID G-QXBPND9VPN) to measure visits and interactions. Google may use cookies and receive technical information such as device/browser details, page URLs and interactions. Avoid entering personal information in site searches. Your browser's privacy settings or blockers may limit collection.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Currency reference rates are requested from Frankfurter. Product photos may load from FindSpreadsheet or seller image hosts. Following a link to Litbuy, Weidian or another platform takes you to a separate service governed by its own terms and privacy practices.</p><h2>Purchases and accounts</h2><p>This site does not provide checkout or a customer account. Enter payment and order information only on the platform you choose. See our <a href="/contact/">contact guidance</a> for the appropriate support destination.</p></main></Base>
